       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. RATESTEP.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 RATE-REQUEST.
   05 BASE-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
   05 UNIT-COUNT PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
   05 RATE-FACTOR PIC 9V99.
01 RATE-RESULT PIC 9(9)V99.
01 RATE-STATUS PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING RATE-REQUEST RATE-RESULT RATE-STATUS.
CALCULATE-AMOUNT.
    MOVE ZERO TO RATE-RESULT RATE-STATUS.
    IF RATE-FACTOR = ZERO
        MOVE 23 TO RATE-STATUS
    ELSE
        COMPUTE RATE-RESULT ROUNDED =
            BASE-AMOUNT * UNIT-COUNT * RATE-FACTOR
            ON SIZE ERROR
                MOVE 24 TO RATE-STATUS
                MOVE ZERO TO RATE-RESULT
        END-COMPUTE
    END-IF.
    GOBACK.
